## Key Concepts
- Adapter/Strategy patterns
- Registry for dynamic composition
- Type safety and error handling in TS

## Code Example

```typescript
interface ProtocolAdapter<TParams, TData> {
  fetch(params: TParams): Promise<TData>;
}
class Registry {
  private map = new Map<string, ProtocolAdapter<any, any>>();
  register(name: string, adapter: ProtocolAdapter<any, any>) { this.map.set(name, adapter); }
  get(name: string) { return this.map.get(name); }
}
```

